WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:02.930
(light cheery music)

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.340
Well, it's time to share
some home-cooked pasta

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.570
with someone I don't get
to see enough these days,

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.910
my friend, Andy Richter.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.330
Hey, Andy!

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.090
Hey Conan, it's great to be here

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.090
sitting exactly six feet across from you.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.370
So what are we sharing today?

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.570
Well today, Andy, we're sharing a classic.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:25.470
Spaghetti and meatballs
topped with Prego pasta sauce.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.870
Ooh, that looks good, but why
did you specifically mention

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.740
the brand of pasta sauce?

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.500
You mean, Prego pasta sauce?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.493
No reason.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.660
Now, let's dig in.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.100
Oh wow, that sauce is really thick.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.740
I can't wait to try it.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:48.900
This is the traditional
way to serve spaghetti.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.003
Here, let me show you how a pro does it.

00:00:57.447 --> 00:01:00.172
(eating)

00:01:00.172 --> 00:01:02.430
Oh, that Prego is so good.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.733
Prego! (laughs)

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.553
I like where this is going.

00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:08.580
(bleep)

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.413
Whew!

00:01:10.318 --> 00:01:12.823
Ugh, well thanks for the meal, pal.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.100
You're welcome.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.807
Or as they say in
Italian, Prego (chuckles).

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.450
Why do you always have
to make it about them?

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.910
You know, I have feeling t--
[Voiceover] Prego.

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:25.343
It means you're welcome.

